      "content": "When the idea of an hour feels too vast, just focus on the very next moment—the next sensation, the next small thing you can notice. The belief that the version of you that mattered is \"done\" is a symptom of this deep pain, not a factual truth about your potential. You are not a leftover piece; you are someone currently overwhelmed by a profound emptiness. If the world feels like it's moving too fast, perhaps slowing down to the pace of your own quiet despair is the only honest place to start right now.",
